{"id":"wb-6-774","name":"开明寺塔","retrievedAt":"2026-11-06T11:54:03+00:00","status":"ready","title":"开明寺塔","text":"开明寺塔建于唐开元中（公元713年），宋庆元元年重修，是陕南最早的古砖塔。1957年成为陕西省文物保护单位。2006年，洋县开明寺塔被国务院公布为第六批国家级重点文物保护单位。\n开明寺塔周围原有一座寺院名为开明寺，因而得名。塔高27米，共13层。每层立面上各设有1个佛龛和2个小塔，共有佛龛52个，小塔104个。塔四角皆有风铃。","shortened":false,"sourceUrl":"https://zh.wikipedia.org/wiki/%E5%BC%80%E6%98%8E%E5%AF%BA%E5%A1%94","revisionId":86786763,"revisionUrl":"https://zh.wikipedia.org/w/index.php?oldid=86786763","license":"CC BY-SA 4.0","licenseUrl":"https://creativecommons.org/licenses/by-sa/4.0/","authors":"维基百科贡献者","matchEvidence":"名称与地理坐标一致","image":{"path":"assets/wikipedia/7a31c0b2a6bef620ba9237fb.jpg","title":"唐代佛塔_-_panoramio_(3).jpg","sourceUrl":"https://commons.wikimedia.org/wiki/File:%E5%94%90%E4%BB%A3%E4%BD%9B%E5%A1%94_-_panoramio_(3).jpg","originalUrl":"https://upload.wikimedia.org/wikipedia/commons/7/71/%E5%94%90%E4%BB%A3%E4%BD%9B%E5%A1%94_-_panoramio_%283%29.jpg?utm_source=commons.wikimedia.org&utm_campaign=imageinfo&utm_content=original","author":"ping lin","license":"CC BY-SA 3.0","licenseUrl":"https://creativecommons.org/licenses/by-sa/3.0","caption":"唐代佛塔","width":320,"height":427}}